# Supabase — copy to .env.local (local dev) and set the same vars in Vercel.
# Both values are PUBLIC client values (safe to ship in the frontend bundle).
# Row Level Security (user_id = auth.uid()) is what protects each user's data.
# Find them in: Supabase dashboard -> Project Settings -> API.
#
# Leave these BLANK to run the app in local-only mode (no auth, no cloud sync) —
# the original offline behavior.

VITE_SUPABASE_URL=
VITE_SUPABASE_ANON_KEY=

# NEVER put the service_role key in this file or anywhere in the frontend.
